  "key_concepts": [
    "Group SOP creates named point or primitive groups for downstream SOP operations.",
    "Elements can belong to multiple groups, so group membership is not exclusive by default.",
    "Create modes include number patterns, ranges, expressions, bounds, normal angle tests, and edge tests.",
    "Combine and Edit pages support boolean set operations, conversion between point and primitive groups, renaming, and deletion."
